<article class="env-lemma" id="0ES4">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0ES4">Lemma <span data-tag="0ES4">82.29.1</span>.</a> In Situation <a href="/tag/0EDT" data-tag="0EDT">82.2.1</a> let $X/B$ be good. Let $\mathcal{E}$ be a finite locally free sheaf of rank $r$ on $X$. Let $\mathcal{L}$ be an invertible sheaf on $X$. Then we have </p>
  <div class="equation" id="0ES5">
    <span class="equation-label"><a href="/tag/0ES5" data-tag="0ES5">82.29.1.1</a></span>
  <div>\begin{equation}  \label{spaces-chow-equation-twist} c_ i({\mathcal E} \otimes {\mathcal L}) = \sum \nolimits _{j = 0}^ i \binom {r - i + j}{j} c_{i - j}({\mathcal E}) c_1({\mathcal L})^ j \end{equation}</div>
</div>
  <p> in $A^*(X)$. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      The proof is identical to the proof of Chow Homology, Lemma <a href="/tag/02UD" data-tag="02UD">42.39.1</a> replacing the lemmas used there by Lemmas <a href="/tag/0ERS" data-tag="0ERS">82.26.9</a> and <a href="/tag/0ERY" data-tag="0ERY">82.28.1</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>